  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Dentist in Katy, TX",
   "html": "<p>Dentist in Katy, TX</p>",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Dr. William Sung and our whole team are proud to be a leading dental practice in beautiful Katy, TX! Please view our website or contact us for more information about our services.",
   "html": "<p>Dr. William Sung and our whole team are proud to be a leading dental practice in beautiful Katy, TX! Please&nbsp;<a href=\"/\">view our website</a>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<a href=\"/contact/\">contact</a>&nbsp;us for more information about our&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/\">services</a>.</p>",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "New to Katy? Here’s some useful information about your new home.",
   "html": "<p>New to Katy? Here’s some useful information about your new home.</p>",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Katy, TX is a community devoted to balancing economic opportunity and historic preservation. Our growing community includes places for hiking, shopping, running, theaters and more!",
   "html": "<p>Katy, TX is a community devoted to balancing economic opportunity and historic preservation. Our growing community includes places for hiking, shopping, running, theaters and more!</p>",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Who you need to know in Katy, TX",
   "html": "<p>Who you need to know in Katy, TX</p>",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Click here to learn more about our County Executive",
   "html": "<p><a href=\"https://www.harriscountytx.gov/County-Judge-and-Commissioners/Harris-County-Elected-Officials\">Click here</a>&nbsp;to learn more about our County Executive</p>",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Click here to learn more about our City Council.",
   "html": "<p><a href=\"https://www.cityofkaty.com/government/mayor-city-council\">Click here</a>&nbsp;to learn more about our City Council.</p>",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Click here to learn more about our Courts.",
   "html": "<p><a href=\"https://www.cityofkaty.com/government/city-departments/municipal-court\">Click here</a>&nbsp;to learn more about our Courts.</p>",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "What you need to know about Katy, TX",
   "html": "<p>What you need to know about Katy, TX</p>",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Katy also has a county Chamber of Commerce that serves to promote growth and success of business and industry in the Katy community. Click here to learn more about the Katy, TX Chamber of Commerce.",
   "html": "<p>Katy also has a county Chamber of Commerce that serves to promote growth and success of business and industry in the Katy community.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.katychamber.com/\">Click here</a>&nbsp;to learn more about the Katy, TX Chamber of Commerce.</p>",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Places to know in Katy, TX",
   "html": "<p>Places to know in Katy, TX</p>",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Katy Police Department is ready and willing to serve and protect our community. Click here to learn more about our Police Department.",
   "html": "<p>Katy Police Department is ready and willing to serve and protect our community.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.cityofkaty.com/government/city-departments/police-department\">Click here</a>&nbsp;to learn more about our Police Department.</p>",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "For Emergency Calls, please dial 911.",
   "html": "<p>For Emergency Calls, please dial 911.</p>",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "For Non-Emergency Calls, please dial phone (713)-884-3131",
   "html": "<p>For Non-Emergency Calls, please dial phone (713)-884-3131</p>",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "We hope you find this page helpful as you settle into your new community. We look forward to seeing you here at BMason Park Family Dental.",
   "html": "<p>We hope you find this page helpful as you settle into your new community. We look forward to seeing you here at BMason Park Family Dental.</p>",
   "section": 5
  },
